<title>HONG KONG: Merrill Lynch sets warrants on HK blue-chip basket.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets warrants on HK blue-chip basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co C.V. said on Wednesday it intended to launch one billion American-style call warrants on a basket of five blue-chip stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises:</p>
<p> Sun Hung Kai Properties Ltd	  0.05 SHARES</p>
<p>Henderson Land Development Co Ltd  0.05 SHARES</p>
<p> Cheung Kong Holdings Ltd	     0.05 SHARES</p>
<p> New World Development Co Ltd	 0.05 SHARES</p>
<p> Sino Land Co Ltd			 0.05 SHARES</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$16.37     PREMIUM	19.6 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.21	GEARING	7.35x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  03.FEB.98    EXER LOT     10,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    PAY DATE     3 WKS AFTER LAUNCH</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    HK$15.44</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW     HONG KONG</p>
<p> NOTE		  CASH OR PHYSICAL SETTLEMENT</p>
<p>	    -- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
